---

### 2. Membership number generation (year segment from registration date)

`src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerMapper.java` (lines 40-47)
```java
default String membershipNumber(Owner owner) {
    String yy = String.format("%02d", owner.getRegistrationDate().getYear() % 100);
    return owner.getCustomerCode() + "-M" + yy;
}
```
